OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Adil tries to help a Glaswegian
OL,7,     Fhiding a large cyst under his hat
OL,8,     Fand Dr Dev long arms a lipoma from
OL,9,     Fa Lancashire detective. Dr Emma
OL,10,     Fcontends with lumps on a ribcage
OL,11,     Fand a cheek.
OL,12,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,13,     FAfter a brutally murdered oil rig
OL,14,     Fworker is found in a burnt-out
OL,15,     Fcar, the quiet Scottish town soon
OL,16,     Fbecomes inflamed with rumours and
OL,17,     Ffear.
